        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "e83a4512-50a3-3c47-b012-496b7f6c496c",
                "word": "copinage",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "8025d538-e6d0-4842-a1fe-301863f29dc4",
                        "entry_id": "e83a4512-50a3-3c47-b012-496b7f6c496c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "copinages"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "39737f4d-bbb5-3e11-bd3f-a0fbe371ca02",
                        "entry_id": "e83a4512-50a3-3c47-b012-496b7f6c496c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Complicité, fait d’être copains."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "familiar"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "184d7184-48bb-4642-8991-fc93b8e4e67a",
                                "sense_id": "39737f4d-bbb5-3e11-bd3f-a0fbe371ca02",
                                "text": "Lors de vos achat, vous serez reçue dans une charmante ambiance et vous bénéficierez d'un accueil des plus chaleureux. Vous vous sentirez comme chez vous, entourée de vos amies. Cette atmosphère de copinage, Nathalie et Joanna l’ont mise en place pour vous, pour que votre passage soit un plaisir et un moment d’évasion, que vous veniez seule ou accompagnée."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5c168f0e-cd76-3dc1-acf5-0b58e6dba7a0",
                        "entry_id": "e83a4512-50a3-3c47-b012-496b7f6c496c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Pratique qui consiste à procurer des avantages ou des positions à ses amis ou à en obtenir d'eux."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "pejorative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1582ed6b-3509-41e9-aa32-485fad68004f",
                                "sense_id": "5c168f0e-cd76-3dc1-acf5-0b58e6dba7a0",
                                "text": "Il a repoussé du pied, face à Mourousi, l’accusation selon laquelle la nomination de son médecin personnel au poste d’inspecteur général de la Santé publique serait un acte de bon copinage."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9cc3a553-7555-4426-9c3b-48ff2f6adc0b",
                                "sense_id": "5c168f0e-cd76-3dc1-acf5-0b58e6dba7a0",
                                "text": "…ses commissions, corruptions, copinages et contre-dénonciations."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "123c2c92-265a-4363-a975-9ea81293aa87",
                                "sense_id": "5c168f0e-cd76-3dc1-acf5-0b58e6dba7a0",
                                "text": "Et puis, le Front, ce sont les identitaires, la soupe au goret, les pro-crucifix et les anti-avortement de la nièce Maréchal-Le Pen, les thés dansants en Australie, les banques amies russes, les copinages syriens, la chasse aux fonctionnaires, l’apologie du revolver (très en vogue chez Ménard Robert), et tout le reste…"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "790f3674-2ae7-35e9-8147-9ec5df967a6d",
                        "entry_id": "e83a4512-50a3-3c47-b012-496b7f6c496c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relations amoureuses entre adolescents."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Afrique"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "87bed7ed-d270-4f96-a883-a42cd652b3e3",
                                "sense_id": "790f3674-2ae7-35e9-8147-9ec5df967a6d",
                                "text": "Une étude en 2006 avait mis en évidence les situations qui exposent particulièrement les filles-élèves aux grossesses (...) « (...) la dégradation des mœurs et le phénomène de copinage (...) »"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6c50dd25-1454-4f68-be71-c1c021a9aaea",
                                "sense_id": "790f3674-2ae7-35e9-8147-9ec5df967a6d",
                                "text": "L’adolescence constitue un âge critique du développement de la personnalité. (...) Le copinage entre adolescents du même sexe ou de sexes différents peuvent aboutir à des pratiques sexuelles déviantes."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4dba9197-2acf-48bd-824b-78295e5061cb",
                        "source_entry_id": "e83a4512-50a3-3c47-b012-496b7f6c496c",
                        "source_sense_description": "Pratique de procurer des avantages à ses amis",
                        "target_lang_word": "Vetternwirtschaft",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Vetternwirtschaft",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "66362484-3d9c-3c7f-b9e5-615415d87f34",
                                        "entry_id": "89fc2bf8-8662-3793-925f-306395d26143",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "übermäßige Begünstigung von Verwandten, zum Beispiel bei der Verteilung von Geldern, der Vergabe von Aufträgen oder der Besetzung von Positionen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e22b6bab-2cd2-413d-b120-205d59373636",
                                                "sense_id": "66362484-3d9c-3c7f-b9e5-615415d87f34",
                                                "text": "Der neue Präsident sagte der Korruption und der Vetternwirtschaft den Kampf an."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06193e08-e0dd-4d8f-a747-351a82aa4d44",
                                                "sense_id": "66362484-3d9c-3c7f-b9e5-615415d87f34",
                                                "text": "„Sie will um jeden Preis dieses Symbol des Totalitarismus, der Vetternwirtschaft, der Manipulation und der Verfolgung beseitigen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6344214a-04a8-4f54-8935-f4e602e3e229",
                                                "sense_id": "66362484-3d9c-3c7f-b9e5-615415d87f34",
                                                "text": "„Diese Maßnahmen änderten jedoch nichts an höchst ineffektiven Umverteilungsmaßnahmen, entsprechender weiterer Verschuldung und dem von Vetternwirtschaft und einseitiger Bevorzugung der Punjabis gekennzeichneten undemokratischen Politikstil.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56c6e67c-8646-4c92-9ba8-78ec3713b415",
                                                "sense_id": "66362484-3d9c-3c7f-b9e5-615415d87f34",
                                                "text": "„Der Untersuchungsausschuss will nun prüfen, ob Vettern- und Parteibuchwirtschaft den Ausschlag bei der Besetzung der Präsidentenstelle des Oberverwaltungsgerichts gab oder die Kompetenz der Bewerber.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "748ee017-ef72-4b67-b591-ace932615417",
                        "source_entry_id": "e83a4512-50a3-3c47-b012-496b7f6c496c",
                        "source_sense_description": "Pratique de procurer des avantages à ses amis",
                        "target_lang_word": "Nepotismus",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Nepotismus",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ef809a2-b416-3cc7-8542-68a1eb592fbd",
                                        "entry_id": "ed222c4f-9fa8-382f-bb56-1a1223f06ae4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Vetternwirtschaft, ungerechtfertigte Begünstigung von Verwandten (z. B. bei Stellenbesetzungen)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94343582-12a6-4c46-8a6d-43884e37c585",
                                                "sense_id": "4ef809a2-b416-3cc7-8542-68a1eb592fbd",
                                                "text": "Luther gefiel der Nepotismus, den der Staat betrieb, nicht."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "512e2670-83f5-4fcc-87db-b657fad1d7cd",
                                                "sense_id": "4ef809a2-b416-3cc7-8542-68a1eb592fbd",
                                                "text": "„Wie gesagt waren damals Simonie (nach dem aus der Apostelgeschichte bekannten Magier Simon benannte Sünde des „geistlichen Wuchers“, Kauf und Verkauf von geistlichen Gütern und Stellen für Geld oder Geldeswert) und Nepotismus (Verwandtenbegünstigung) verbreitete Erscheinungen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c15b46d-5334-4969-a2af-bb222278c37e",
                                                "sense_id": "4ef809a2-b416-3cc7-8542-68a1eb592fbd",
                                                "text": "„Der Schluss, der in dem Artikel aus der Kaufsumme gezogen wurde, lautete, derart grober Nepotismus sei eine Bedrohung für die Demokratie.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "faa9c163-4c15-443b-af70-d3e9f08ebbf9",
                        "source_entry_id": "e83a4512-50a3-3c47-b012-496b7f6c496c",
                        "source_sense_description": "Pratique de procurer des avantages à ses amis",
                        "target_lang_word": "Freunderlwirtschaft",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Freunderlwirtschaft",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "419419c2-f6db-3850-9103-322476e4f65b",
                                        "entry_id": "aea5d317-2c21-3812-a72a-59cf053446c5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "übermäßige Begünstigung von Bekannten oder Verwandten, zum Beispiel bei der Verteilung von Geldern, der Vergabe von Aufträgen oder der Besetzung von Positionen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Austrian German",
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29c5d8d4-9a4f-4ecb-b387-ac9539472361",
                                                "sense_id": "419419c2-f6db-3850-9103-322476e4f65b",
                                                "text": "„Freunderlwirtschaft ist offenbar auch Teil ihrer politischen DNA.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "119e08f8-893b-4fe8-a4a5-5c0af5150f5b",
                        "source_entry_id": "e83a4512-50a3-3c47-b012-496b7f6c496c",
                        "source_sense_description": "Pratique de procurer des avantages à ses amis",
                        "target_lang_word": "cronyism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cronyism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "41717d33-fb1b-3710-be5b-2c616224ad84",
                                        "entry_id": "7fb1b855-c1af-35c0-b242-9cc4e0b1f257",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Favouritism to friends without regard for their qualifications; especially (politics), in their appointment to political positions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3bbb113f-90a6-46b9-8084-8174c290fff0",
                                                "sense_id": "41717d33-fb1b-3710-be5b-2c616224ad84",
                                                "text": "[T]he present structure of the collective bargaining agreement, combined with nepotism and cronyism and other abuses in employment and referral practices, have perpetuated the effects of the past discrimination, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bec41cb0-7010-437e-9e03-6b6ea3c3a1a7",
                                                "sense_id": "41717d33-fb1b-3710-be5b-2c616224ad84",
                                                "text": "[Robert L.] Hagist began what he called an \"18 month reform program\" that included revised warehouse procedures and measures to prevent the leakages, shortages, cronyisms, and politicking attributed to the managers and clerks of the various stores."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20f17818-78b0-4720-8142-3310ca21e071",
                                                "sense_id": "41717d33-fb1b-3710-be5b-2c616224ad84",
                                                "text": "If we are going to reauthorize the National Endowment, we need to see to it that the Endowment, in its procedures, are open, one. […] That there is a cessation of a long-term practice of cronyisms on the panels so that artists across the Nation have equal access to this."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1fcd828b-e80c-4f94-a52c-ed536c3206b5",
                                                "sense_id": "41717d33-fb1b-3710-be5b-2c616224ad84",
                                                "text": "[C]ommunism is predicated upon a central structure of economic command that is singularly entrusted with allocating resources and making economic decisions. Because of this centralized command structure, communist societies fall prey to the forces of cronyism and influence-peddling as commune members without economic power curry favor with commune leaders that control access to resources."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "71509182-e7cc-4690-8e19-70548da487ac",
                                                "sense_id": "41717d33-fb1b-3710-be5b-2c616224ad84",
                                                "text": "Patronage, nepotism, cronyism, abuse of power, and criminal activity flourish, sometimes for decades, in numerous town halls, police stations, and special-purpose government agencies in the suburbs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11ad318d-58f4-46d9-9ba7-7a71ba36aa1f",
                                                "sense_id": "41717d33-fb1b-3710-be5b-2c616224ad84",
                                                "text": "Critics accuse her [von der Leyen] of serious missteps over the pandemic, the Gaza war, alleged cronyism, – and of having a high-handed manner."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9e7f90bc-5122-31d4-a610-6f12fad3f0d2",
                                        "entry_id": "7fb1b855-c1af-35c0-b242-9cc4e0b1f257",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The condition of being friends; friendship; also, the ability or inclination to make friends."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "30425892-0bbf-46bc-880d-03e307414f39",
                                                "sense_id": "9e7f90bc-5122-31d4-a610-6f12fad3f0d2",
                                                "text": "[T]he preacher […] was reading to them the duty of loving one another as Christians, But only particularly and exclusively were they to love one another \"as Christians,\" that is as confederates and caballers together in a particular interest, distinct from that of the great family of mankind; […] The benefit to themselves from this Free-masonry sectarian cronyism, (for which the uninitiated world is so much obliged to them) was, to be, that […] [t]he spirit of God was to bear witness with their spirits, and to settle the matter of faith with a degree of conviction, that should render reason superfluous and inquiry unnecessary."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "21630c82-81f5-429c-8ef8-1a0bdd7f484a",
                                                "sense_id": "9e7f90bc-5122-31d4-a610-6f12fad3f0d2",
                                                "text": "Our friend the Old Crony, we see, for all his connoisseurship and crony-ism, his regard for a certain piquancy of perfection in the French dress and walk, and his wish that his fair countrywomen would \"take steps\" after their fashion, cannot get rid of the preference in which he was brought up for the beauty of the English countenance."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0561e1a-84bf-452f-b0ac-8612ab7a416d",
                                                "sense_id": "9e7f90bc-5122-31d4-a610-6f12fad3f0d2",
                                                "text": "She [the minister's wife] is warned against being drawn into excessive attachments, engrossing intimacies, low and gossiping cronyism, all intermeddling with tales and talebearers, with family breaches, with partisanship, and with ecclesiastical jurisdiction."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5dd5b02-6fe0-4d3d-8eca-653999ac1936",
                                                "sense_id": "9e7f90bc-5122-31d4-a610-6f12fad3f0d2",
                                                "text": "[H]e [William Jay] observed, that there were two things which caused religious servants to be too generally disliked. The first was their fondness for religious gossiping, or cronyism, which made them regardless of their time, &c."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6047b73-1dc4-4891-8a50-8f9e7c9d6b2d",
                                                "sense_id": "9e7f90bc-5122-31d4-a610-6f12fad3f0d2",
                                                "text": "Pea-green Hayne was one of my most intimate friends; we occupied rooms vis à vis, and made prison life more than endurable by affectionate cronyism."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc690bab-1bbc-4077-9e24-f4876ce83e50",
                                                "sense_id": "9e7f90bc-5122-31d4-a610-6f12fad3f0d2",
                                                "text": "And the Englishman and Irishman went off together in a state of thorough cronyism, the former imagining that he had quite taken in his companion, and entertaining no suspicion that it was rather the other way."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
